## Summary
- New Club model (1:1 with a "club"-role User) and optional Team.clubId link
- /club dashboard (profile, create-squad, roster management) and /club/edit
- Squads reuse the existing /coach/teams/[teamId]/* pages (roster, planner,
  matches, recovery, injuries, etc.) instead of duplicating club-specific UI
- /club/recruitment: watchlist + contact requests, wiring up the previously
  schema-only ScoutWatchlist/ScoutContactRequest models
- Athlete profile gets working "Watchlist"/"Request contact" actions for
  club viewers, plus an Accept/Decline flow with real notifications
- Removed a dead "Send contact request" button that was shown to every
  profile viewer and did nothing

## Test plan
- Sign up with role "Club / Academy" → /club/edit → /club
- Create a squad, add/remove athletes from its roster, open its dashboard
- From /club/recruitment: watchlist an unclaimed athlete, send a contact
  request to a claimed one
- Log in as that athlete, confirm the request + notification appear,
  accept it, confirm status flips on the club side
- Confirm existing coach accounts (e.g. marcus@example.com) are unaffected
